          "The interesting part is that both models benefit from the same underlying engine. More health awareness means more tests. More tests mean more interpretation. More insured lives mean more claims. More claims mean more admin. The market doesn\u2019t need every consumer app to list. It just needs the rails that convert activity into cash flow.",
